# Production build settings (vite build / npm run build).
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL: same-origin path the host reverse-proxies to the backend.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
#
# VITE_LIVE_REPORT_VIEWER_BASE_URL is REQUIRED for a production build and is
# intentionally not committed here. Provide the deployed viewer origin, e.g.
#   VITE_LIVE_REPORT_VIEWER_BASE_URL=https://viewer.example.com
# through the build environment (CI secret/variable) or an untracked
# .env.production.local file. It must be a bare https origin that matches the
# backend LIVE_REPORT_VIEWER_BASE_URL. vite.config.ts stops the build when it
# is empty or points to localhost (set LIVE_REPORT_VIEWER_ALLOW_LOCAL=true only
# for a deliberate local production build).
